@host = http://localhost:7071

### Get your profile
GET {{host}}/api/users/{{userId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{id_token}}

### Search users (admin token)
GET {{host}}/api/users?search={{email}}&page=0&pageSize=10
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

### Broadcast snapshot
POST {{host}}/api/users/{{userId}}/broadcast
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reason": "loan-status-change",
  "correlationId": "{{correlationId}}"
}
